Project modification notice: GE-Proton macOS Wine PoC
Modification date: 2026-11-24
Scope: Add configurable cursor clip suppression (AllowClipCursor/WINE_CLIP_CURSOR) and WINE_EMULATE_MODESET env override, clear stale server cursor clips and exclusive present rects across fullscreen/windowed transitions, keep macOS window mouseConfinementRect synchronized on resize/fullscreen changes, and support external mouse capture release notifications.
